      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i take sertraline for my anxiety (been on it like 2 years) but my back is killing me so i took some tramadol earlier. i feel kinda jittery and my heart is racing a bit, is that just the pain or is it okay to take them together? i dont wanna go to the er or anything if it's nothing",
